---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why most videos don't work — and how Attention Earned fixes that."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="kicker">About</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Your video looks great. So why isn't it working?</h1>
      <p class="hero-body">
        You spent $10K on a video. It's beautifully shot. The edit is clean.
        You posted it on LinkedIn, put it on your homepage, maybe ran some ads.
        And nothing. 47 views. No leads. No conversions. Just sitting there,
        expensive and useless.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="inner">

      <div class="block">
        <p class="block-label">Three questions nobody asked</p>
        <div class="questions">
          <div class="question">
            <div class="q-num">01</div>
            <div class="q-body">
              <h3>Who's actually watching this?</h3>
              <p>Not "your target audience." The specific person who needs to take action. Investors? Customers? Employees? Each one needs to hear something different.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="question">
            <div class="q-num">02</div>
            <div class="q-body">
              <h3>What do they need to hear to take action?</h3>
              <p>Your pitch deck talking points don't work on video. Buzzwords don't work. Generic brand messaging doesn't work. You need something a human would actually care about.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="question">
            <div class="q-num">03</div>
            <div class="q-body">
              <h3>Where is this going to live?</h3>
              <p>A founder story for paid social is different from one for your investor deck. A product video for your homepage is different from one for a sales call. Most producers make "a video" and hope it works everywhere. It doesn't.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <h2>What changes when you get this right</h2>
        <div class="outcome-grid">
          <div class="outcome-card">
            <p class="outcome-card__text">Your fundraising video actually raises money. Not just applause at the gala. Actual donations from people who finally understand why your work matters.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="outcome-card">
            <p class="outcome-card__text">Your paid ads convert. Because the messaging is sharp, the story is real, and it's built for the platform where people will see it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="outcome-card">
            <p class="outcome-card__text">Your founder story positions you. Not as "another startup" but as the company solving this specific problem in a way nobody else can.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="outcome-card">
            <p class="outcome-card__text">Your product video drives action. Because prospects finally understand what you do and why they should care.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote>
        "The difference between a video that works and one that doesn't isn't
        production quality. It's whether you said the right thing to the right people."
      </blockquote>

      <div class="block">
        <h2>How this works</h2>
        <ol class="process-list">
          <li class="process-item">
            <span class="process-num">01</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Figure out what to say.</strong>
              <p>I'll push you past buzzwords and safe corporate messaging until we get to something real. If your answer sounds like everyone else in your category, we're not done yet.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="process-item">
            <span class="process-num">02</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Make it work for where it's going.</strong>
              <p>Different platforms, different audiences, different goals. Each one needs a different approach. We're not making "a video." We're making something that works in your actual campaign.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="process-item">
            <span class="process-num">03</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Execute it right.</strong>
              <p>Real production quality, not agency markup. Small operation, low overhead, but I can scale up when projects need it.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <h2>Who this is for</h2>
        <div class="audience-grid">
          <div class="audience-card">
            <p class="audience-card__label">B2B / Startups</p>
            <p class="audience-card__text">Video actually driving leads, not just sitting on your website.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="audience-card">
            <p class="audience-card__label">Founders raising capital</p>
            <p class="audience-card__text">Nail your positioning on video before you walk into investor meetings.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="audience-card">
            <p class="audience-card__label">Nonprofits</p>
            <p class="audience-card__text">Fundraising videos that open checkbooks, not just get polite applause.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="audience-card">
            <p class="audience-card__label">Paid campaigns</p>
            <p class="audience-card__text">Creative built for conversion, not just brand awareness.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <h2>Why this is different</h2>
        <div class="diff-list">
          <div class="diff-item">
            <strong>Most video producers are order-takers.</strong>
            <p>You tell them what you want, they shoot it, send you the files. If your messaging is wrong, they'll make it look beautiful anyway.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="diff-item">
            <strong>I push back.</strong>
            <p>If your messaging sounds like buzzwords, I'll tell you. If your idea won't work for paid social, I'll explain why. We figure out what to say before we figure out what to shoot.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="diff-item">
            <strong>I think about campaigns, not just videos.</strong>
            <p>Where is this going to live? Who's watching? What do you need them to do? Most producers never ask. I start there.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="diff-item">
            <strong>You're not paying agency overhead.</strong>
            <p>No conference rooms, no account managers, no markup for using someone else's crew. Small shop efficiency, professional execution.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="block">
        <h2>Quick credibility check</h2>
        <p class="prose-p">Grew up around nonprofits and learned how to extract real stories from people who normally give canned responses. Now I use those same skills with founders and executives who hide behind jargon.</p>
        <p class="prose-p">Done everything from 15-second social ads to 70-interview documentaries. Worked with nonprofits raising millions, startups pitching VCs, and B2B companies trying to break through the noise.</p>
        <p class="prose-p">Real production experience from actual film sets. I know the craft. I also know marketing. That combination is rare.</p>
        <div class="sample-links">
          <a href="/cinematography-work-samples" class="sample-link">Cinematography samples →</a>
          <a href="/work" class="sample-link">Full work gallery →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand
    heading="Let's figure out what you actually need."
    accentPhrase="No pitch. No BS."
    body="Tell me what you're trying to accomplish. I'll ask questions. We'll figure out if video solves it, what you should say, and where it needs to work."
    primaryLabel="Start the conversation"
    primaryHref="/contact"
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-inline: var(--gutter);
  }

  /* Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0 3rem;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 1.6rem + 3vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: var(--fw-black);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    max-width: 22ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  /* Content */
  .content-section {
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .block {
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .block h2 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-black);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .block-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .prose-p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Questions */
  .questions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .question {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .q-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .q-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .q-body p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Outcome grid */
  .outcome-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .outcome-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .outcome-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .outcome-card__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Blockquote */
  blockquote {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
  }

  /* Process list */
  .process-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .process-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .process-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .process-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .process-item p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Audience grid */
  .audience-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .audience-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .audience-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .audience-card__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .audience-card__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Diff list */
  .diff-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diff-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .diff-item p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Sample links */
  .sample-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sample-link {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--dur-fast);
  }

  .sample-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .question, .process-item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
